THIRD-PARTY NOTICES & DISCLAIMERS
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This project is an independent fan companion app and is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the following:

  • Jumbo Games / Identity Games — creators of the Hitster® card game
  • Apple Inc. — Apple Music, iTunes
  • Spotify AB

HITSTER® is a registered trademark of Jumbo/Identity Games. All rights
reserved by their respective owners.

─── Card metadata (cards-il.json) ────────────────────────────────────────────

The file cards-il.json contains a mapping of Hitster card numbers to Spotify
track identifiers. This mapping was derived from data publicly served by
Jumbo's Hitster API (hitster.jumboplay.com) solely to enable users who already
own physical Hitster cards to look up the song on Apple Music. No song audio,
artwork, lyrics, or other copyrightable content is stored in this repository.

Use of this app requires possession of genuine physical Hitster cards.
This project does not reproduce, replace, or substitute the Hitster game.

─── Apple iTunes Search API ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

Song metadata and 30-second preview clips are fetched at runtime from Apple's
iTunes Search API (itunes.apple.com/search). Apple's 30-second previews are
provided by Apple solely for the purpose of song identification and linking
to Apple Music. This app does not store, cache, or redistribute these previews.
Usage complies with Apple's API terms of service for non-commercial linking.

─── Spotify oEmbed API ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Track titles and artwork thumbnails are fetched at runtime from Spotify's
oEmbed endpoint (open.spotify.com/oembed), which is publicly accessible and
intended for third-party embedding per Spotify's developer terms.
